<title>THAILAND: Songkhla Canning Q4 net profit lower.</title>
<headline>Songkhla Canning Q4 net profit lower.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited consolidated financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Fourth quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 0.42     vs	     1.14</p>
<p>    Net			  7.62     vs	    20.50</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 6.42	vs	     9.00</p>
<p>    Net			115.5	 vs	   162.02</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Songkhla Canninc Plc., a producer of canned seafood.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
